  "blocks": {
    "\"It's been blocked on a permission request for ten minutes — I was in a meeting.\"": "“它被一个权限请求卡了十分钟——刚才我在开会。”",
    "\"That's the cost of human-in-the-loop. Pre-approve the safe tools so the request only fires on the actually-risky calls.\"": "“这就是人工介入的代价。预先批准安全<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool\">工具</a>，让权限请求只在真正有风险的调用上触发。”",
    "Denying a request steers the agent. The model reads the denial like any other tool result and reacts to it — it tries a different approach, or asks what you'd prefer. Most harnesses let you attach a message to the denial, which turns the request into a steering point: \"not like that, use the migration script instead\" lands exactly when the model is deciding what to do next.": "拒绝请求也在引导智能体。模型会像读取其他工具结果一样读取拒绝信息，并据此作出反应——尝试另一种方法，或询问你希望如何处理。多数运行框架允许在拒绝时附加一条消息，这就把权限请求变成了精准的引导节点。例如“不要这样做，改用迁移脚本”，恰好会在模型决定下一步时送达。",
    "The cost is that every request is a synchronous wait on you. The agent sits blocked until you answer, which is fine while you're watching and a problem when you're not — an agent that triggers requests constantly can't be left to work AFK. The permission mode is the dial: which calls run freely, which ask first, ideally with a sandbox making it safe to widen the free set.": "代价是每次请求都必须同步等待你回答。<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>会一直阻塞到你作出选择；你盯着运行时问题不大，离开后就会变成障碍——持续触发请求的智能体无法真正 <a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/afk\">AFK</a> 工作。权限模式就是调节旋钮：决定哪些调用可以直接运行，哪些必须先询问；理想情况下，再通过<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/sandbox\">沙箱</a>提供安全边界，从而扩大可自由执行的范围。",
    "The lifecycle of a permission request:": "一次权限请求的生命周期如下：",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>",
    "What the harness shows the user before executing a tool call that isn't pre-approved. The model produces a tool call; instead of running it immediately, the harness pauses and asks. Approve and it runs; deny and the harness reports the denial back to the model as a tool result. The mechanism by which a harness puts a human in the loop for risky or sensitive actions.": "权限请求是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/harness\">运行框架</a>在执行未预先批准的<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-call\">工具调用</a>前向用户展示的确认。<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>生成工具调用后，运行框架不会立即执行，而是暂停并询问用户。批准后调用继续运行；拒绝后，运行框架会把拒绝信息作为<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-result\">工具结果</a>反馈给模型。这是运行框架针对高风险或敏感操作引入<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/human-in-the-loop\">人工介入</a>的机制。"
  },
